    button .createByCur at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Cursor' pixmap width 19 height 19 call |Call !!mdsCreateFt46('CURSOR')|
    button .createByDim at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Dimensions' pixmap width 19 height 19 call |Call !!mdsCreateFt46('DIMENSION')|
    button .createByCle at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Clearance' pixmap width 19 height 19 call |Call !!mdsCreateFt46('CLEARANCE')|

    para   .tCode   at x1 ymax+0.2 text |Support Code|
