    button .delPack       at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Delete Packer'      pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!mdsdelft25(!!mdsFT46)|
    button .rotate        at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Rotate All Attas'        pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!mdsIRotan(!!mdsFT46,'!!mdsRotateFt46()')|
